{
  "_about": "Outgrown rows that meet at the back at an angle (the user, 24 Oct: where two outgrown rows askew to each other meet, the gardens 'take jagged edges and steal land from each other'; a designer would use as few bends as possible). Five small cases, each grown once with Outgrow on and saved, so outgrow-askew.json loads the very same buildings every time: 'PM Askew Angle' (two straight streets at 15 degrees, the rows closing in), 'PM Askew Curve' (a straight street, a curved one behind it), 'PM Askew Curves' (two curves bulging toward each other), 'PM Askew Culdesac' (a turning circle backing onto a straight street), 'PM Askew Corner' (two straight streets at 35 degrees). After the save every garden is planned again with every pass written down (passes/, for OutgrowBench --explain) and mapped (fenceMap), one picture each. The waits are limits: growth stops 8 s after the last building, polishIdle as soon as Outgrow is idle. Send with: powershell -File tools/suite/Send-Suite.ps1 -File suite/scenarios/outgrow-askew-make.json -Who outgrow-askew",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "angle",
      "land": { "shape": "rect", "size": [300, 260], "ground": "flat", "roads": "none" },
      "steps": [
        { "do": "setting", "name": "NeighbourhoodPolish", "value": true },
        { "do": "setting", "name": "PolishNewHouses", "value": true },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "street", "shape": "straight", "at": [0, 58], "yaw": 0, "length": 170, "zone": "NA Residential Low" },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "street", "shape": "straight", "at": [0, -50], "yaw": 15, "length": 170, "zone": "NA Residential Low" },
        { "do": "grow", "seconds": 120 },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "polishIdle", "seconds": 90 },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "saveCity", "name": "PM Askew Angle" },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "polishPassDump", "max": 200, "dir": "angle" },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "polishSettings", "settings": {} },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "polishIdle", "seconds": 90 },
        { "do": "lab", "op": "fenceMap", "box": "gardens", "label": "angle", "closeups": 0, "junctions": 0, "edges": 0 },
        { "do": "shot", "name": "angle", "camera": { "target": "point", "at": [0, 4], "view": "top", "distance": 210 }, "shotMode": "render" }
